  "body": "Positioned in a sought-after pocket of Milford, 75 Forrest Hill Road offers an exceptional combination of family-friendly living, outstanding schooling, panoramic views and exciting future potential.\r\n\r\nFor families, the location is hard to beat. Forrest Hill School and Westlake Boys’ High School are both approximately a two-minute walk away, making the daily school run simple and convenient. The property is also zoned for Westlake Girls’ High School and Takapuna Intermediate, adding further appeal for families planning for the future.\r\n\r\nThe existing solid-brick, two-level home has been beautifully renovated, offering three generous bedrooms and two modern bathrooms. Comfortable to live in or rent out, the home provides flexibility while you consider the property’s future potential.\r\n\r\nFrom the upper level, enjoy 180-degree ocean and city views, creating a stunning backdrop to everyday living.\r\n\r\nFor those looking beyond the existing home, the opportunity becomes even more compelling. The property is freehold and zoned Mixed Housing Urban, with Resource Consent already approved for two luxury terrace homes. The rare flat, road-frontage section provides a practical foundation for the approved development.\r\n\r\nEstablished height-to-boundary easements and the neighbouring near-new, high-spec home further enhance the site’s appeal and provide a favourable setting for future plans.\r\n\r\nLocation is another major advantage. With a bus stop right at the doorstep, motorway access, Milford Centre, Milford Beach, Smales Farm and North Shore Hospital are all approximately five minutes away by car.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re looking for a family home within walking distance of some of the North Shore’s most sought-after schools, a solid investment, or an approved development opportunity, 75 Forrest Hill Road offers a rare combination of lifestyle and potential.\r\n\r\nWalk to school. Enjoy the views. Unlock the future.\r\n\r\nContact us today for further information or to arrange your private viewing.",
